WEBVTT

00:06:56.840 --> 00:07:01.269
will make the world a kinder
and more equal place

00:07:01.293 --> 00:07:05.840
and combat the bigotry and hate
that festers in our world.

00:07:08.154 --> 00:07:12.633
So, talk to a kid about gender.

00:07:13.174 --> 00:07:15.435
Talk to a kid about sexuality.

00:07:15.459 --> 00:07:17.220
Teach them about consent.

00:07:17.244 --> 00:07:20.320
Tell them it is OK
for boys to wear dresses

00:07:20.344 --> 00:07:22.773
and for girls to speak up.

00:07:23.499 --> 00:07:27.257
Let's spread radical queer joy.

00:07:28.558 --> 00:07:29.728
Thank you.

00:07:29.752 --> 00:07:32.704
(Applause)